                                                "sense_id": "8a72039e-e47b-3920-a407-5604ed5ab9d4",
                                                "text": "There are six permutations of three elements, e.g. {abc, acb, bac, bca, cab, cba}."
                                            }
                                        ]
                                    },
                                    {
                                        "sense_id": "f07a41a6-94c1-3067-a65a-0f4a2ebfb854",
